   "found_by": "User report",
   "detail": "oc logs -f and oc get pods -w on oac-prod-workload0 ended after 30 seconds of silence, because the pfSense HAProxy frontends and backends in front of each hosted cluster kept their 30 s default client and server timeouts. naved001 raised both to one hour on every frontend and backend on 10/5, and schwesig measured all three workload clusters before and after. The setting is now in oac-apps docs/firewall-rules.md with a verify check (e00f769, 9ae79f5); the firewall itself is not in Git, and the issue stays open until the reporter confirms with real workloads.",
